title: Scale validator self-stake incentive by era-points performance
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Validator self-stake incentive payout is now scaled by `p_i / max(p_j)`, the validator's era points relative to the top performer.
    Forfeited shares stay in the era pot (not redistributed).
crates:
- name: pallet-staking-async
  bump: minor
